Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.39,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias's newspaper was dated\Ntomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:03.70,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He lived alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:04.88,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He had no subscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.94,Midnight,,0,0,0,,A misprint — until page nine\Nreported his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.77,Midnight,,0,0,0,,death. Apartment fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.21,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Friday. Three a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:13.82,Midnight,,0,0,0,,His name. He booked a hotel across
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:16.41,Midnight,,0,0,0,,town. Saturday's paper was at the\Nfront
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.77,Midnight,,0,0,0,,desk. The fire happened anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.59,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Same building. Same hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.64,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Different man. The dead man was\Nhis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.70,Midnight,,0,0,0,,neighbour, who'd knocked to warn\Nhim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:27.65,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias spread every paper he'd\Nsaved across
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.82,Midnight,,0,0,0,,the floor. All dated tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:31.98,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Each mentioned him less than the\Nlast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:33.44,Midnight,,0,0,0,,First his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:34.40,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Then his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:35.66,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Then the crossword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:38.13,Midnight,,0,0,0,,By Friday, his photograph was a\Ngrey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:41.22,Midnight,,0,0,0,,rectangle. Saturday's paper\Narrived blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:42.82,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Only the masthead remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:46.08,Midnight,,0,0,0,,The Midnight Archive: all the news\Nthat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.41,Midnight,,0,0,0,,never was. Elias finally\Nunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:51.31,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It wasn't predicting his future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.15,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It was deciding what to keep.
